# Feed Import - en_GB (British English; complete, so British users never fall back to en_US wording)
ModuleFeedImportName = Feed Import
ModuleFeedImportDesc = Imports supplier product feeds (CSV, XML) received by FTP, SFTP, FTPS, HTTP or email into products: prices, stock and new products
Permission59120001 = See supplier feed imports and the review queue
Permission59120002 = Run supplier feeds and resolve the review queue

# Menus
FeedImportMenu = Supplier feeds
FeedImportRuns = Imports
FeedImportReview = Review queue
FeedImportSetupMenu = Feeds setup
FeedImportCronRun = Feed import: run the supplier feeds that are due
FeedImportCronRunHelp = Runs every feed whose scheduled time has come, and the feeds that received their file by email.
FeedImportNothingDue = No feed is due.

# Setup: feeds list
FeedImportSetup = Supplier feeds setup
FeedImportSetupHelp = Each supplier feed has its own tab. A feed fetches the supplier's CSV or XML file (FTP, FTPS, SFTP, HTTP, or an email received by an Email Collector), and updates the products it lists: prices, the supplier's stock in a warehouse of its own, and new products. Items that leave the feed keep their product, with their stock set to 0.
FeedImportFeeds = Feeds
FeedImportFeed = Feed
FeedImportAddFeed = Add new feed
FeedImportNewFeedTab = New feed
FeedImportNoFeed = No feed yet. Use "Add new feed".
FeedImportReady = Everything the feeds need is enabled.
FeedImportProblemCron = The Scheduled jobs module is disabled: feeds are not run on their schedule, and files received by email are not imported. Enable it, or run the feeds by hand.
FeedImportProblemStock = The Stocks module is disabled: the feeds cannot set the supplier's stock, nor set to 0 the stock of the items that leave a feed.
FeedImportProblemSupplier = The Vendors module (purchase orders or invoices) is disabled: buy prices and supplier references cannot be imported.
FeedImportProblemEmailCollector = The Email Collector module is disabled: feeds received by email cannot work.
FeedImportProblemCurl = The PHP curl extension is missing: no feed can be fetched from a server.
FeedImportProblemProtocol = This server's curl cannot use %s. Ask the host to install a curl with that protocol (for SFTP: libcurl built with libssh or libssh2).
FeedImportProblemXml = The PHP xmlreader extension is missing: XML feeds cannot be read.
FeedImportModuleNumber = Module number
FeedImportDocumentation = Documentation
FeedImportDocumentationHelp = README.md and docs/ in the module's directory (htdocs/custom/feedimport).
FeedImportSupportNotice = Internal module, maintained in our Dolibarr repository.

