FeedImportDecimal = Decimal separator
FeedImportDecimalDot = Full stop (12.50)
FeedImportDecimalComma = Comma (12,50)
FeedImportSchema = Schema document
FeedImportSchemaHelp = Optional. XML: the feed's XSD. It gives the item element and the fields with their types, and every file is checked against it before anything is imported. Add dolibarr:field="buy_price" (namespace xmlns:dolibarr="urn:dolibarr") to an element of the XSD to map it automatically. CSV (or XML): a two-row CSV file, the first row the feed's column titles, the second row the Dolibarr field of each (sku, label, buy_price...; empty = ignored). Uploading a schema replaces the mapping.
FeedImportSchemaXsd = XSD
FeedImportSchemaMapping = mapping file
FeedImportDownloadTemplate = Download the mapping as a two-row file
